{"3568210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gutter", "steam_appid": 3568210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/extras/14c99088b1deee37b21da699f66dff84.avif?t=1781015400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/extras_big/14c99088b1deee37b21da699f66dff84.avif?t=1781015400 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An astronaut girl who accidentally falls into an unknown world due to a navigational accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking through the dark ruins of an old civilization, everything around you is steeped in mystery and silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that accompanies you is a bird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the aesthetics of <strong><i>Limbo</i></strong> and <strong><i>Badland</i></strong>, this platform puzzle game requires you to face the darkness and the unknown, interacting with a variety of nearly intact but somehow abandoned machinery, and blazing a trail to discover the secrets of an old civilization hidden in the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive audio-visual gameplay inspired by the aesthetics of <i>Limbo</i> and <i>Badland</i>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, flexible and controllable 2D controls to navigate through the ruins with a light touch.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 2D physics engine that's as realistic as it is brutal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistons, electromagnets, robotic arms, enjoy the simple pleasure of interacting with all kinds of machines.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the guidance of curiosity and playfulness to discover unknown mysteries in seemingly pointless attempts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/extras/416b9eefbd80f7f647778cc97bcd0016.avif?t=1781015400\" width=800 height=252 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/extras/14c99088b1deee37b21da699f66dff84.avif?t=1781015400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/extras_big/14c99088b1deee37b21da699f66dff84.avif?t=1781015400 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An astronaut girl who accidentally falls into an unknown world due to a navigational accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking through the dark ruins of an old civilization, everything around you is steeped in mystery and silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that accompanies you is a bird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the aesthetics of <strong><i>Limbo</i></strong> and <strong><i>Badland</i></strong>, this platform puzzle game requires you to face the darkness and the unknown, interacting with a variety of nearly intact but somehow abandoned machinery, and blazing a trail to discover the secrets of an old civilization hidden in the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive audio-visual gameplay inspired by the aesthetics of <i>Limbo</i> and <i>Badland</i>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, flexible and controllable 2D controls to navigate through the ruins with a light touch.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 2D physics engine that's as realistic as it is brutal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistons, electromagnets, robotic arms, enjoy the simple pleasure of interacting with all kinds of machines.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the guidance of curiosity and playfulness to discover unknown mysteries in seemingly pointless attempts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/extras/416b9eefbd80f7f647778cc97bcd0016.avif?t=1781015400\" width=800 height=252 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore the quiet ruins of an old civilization alone, fiddling with levers, buttons and various mechanics to forge a path forward with the help of wits and physics in this unique 2D physics platformer puzzle game. Stay curious and playful, this dark unknown world may not be as scary as you think.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/731daf96329653801739afbcaecac10811aba862/header.jpg?t=1781015400", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/3db6c5c70edda84371332aacc55c467a0540ae93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781015400", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568210/3db6c5c70edda84371332aacc55c467a0540ae93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781015400", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li